CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786465167
OL,3,CWoman given hospital order for killing
OL,4,Cdisabled woman in sheltered
OL,5,Caccommodation
OL,7,FA woman with schizophrenia who killed
OL,8,Fa disabled woman in her own home in
OL,9,FCounty Durham has been sentenced to a
OL,10,Fhospital order.
OL,12,FPatricia Hewitt, 42, stabbed Angela
OL,13,FLloyd 47 times in her sheltered
OL,14,Faccommodation bungalow in Newton
OL,15,FAycliffe on 13 August last year.
OL,17,FHours earlier Hewitt had been given a
OL,18,Fsuspended prison sentence, and spoken
OL,19,Fto a police community support
OL,20,Fofficers, Teesside Crown Court heard.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
