OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,399,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786465167
OL,3,CWoman given hospital order for killing
OL,4,Cdisabled woman in sheltered
OL,5,Caccommodation
OL,7,FThe court was told Hewitt had a
OL,8,Fhistory of mental illness, as well as
OL,9,Fa long record of drug abuse and
OL,10,Fcriminal convictions.
OL,12,FShe denied murder but admitted
OL,13,Fmanslaughter on the grounds of
OL,14,Fdiminished responsibility.
OL,16,FJolyon Perks, prosecuting, said that
OL,17,Fplea had been accepted "following a
OL,18,Fthorough review and expert opinion of
OL,19,Fthree psychiatrists".
OL,26,@yD@XOU{D@TO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
