OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,399,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786465167
OL,3,CWoman given hospital order for killing
OL,4,Cdisabled woman in sheltered
OL,5,Caccommodation
OL,7,FOn Wednesday (5 August), Hewitt was
OL,8,Fsentenced to a hospital order after a
OL,9,Fjudge heard a psychiatrist's
OL,10,Frecommendation that that would be the
OL,11,Fbest way to ensure "long-term public
OL,12,Fsafety".
OL,14,FThe court heard Hewitt was arrested
OL,15,Fthe day before she killed Ms Lloyd,
OL,16,F56, for punching a woman in the head,
OL,17,Fand appeared in court after being held
OL,18,Fovernight, where she pleaded guilty to
OL,19,Fthe assault and was given a suspended
OL,20,Fprison sentence.
OL,26,@sD@TOUtD@GO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,399,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786465167
OL,3,CWoman given hospital order for killing
OL,4,Cdisabled woman in sheltered
OL,5,Caccommodation
OL,7,FMr Perks said she then went to her
OL,8,Fsister's house, where she was
OL,9,Fdescribed as "flustered and talking in
OL,10,Friddles".
OL,12,FHewitt was later spoken to by police
OL,13,Fcommunity support officers (PCSOs)
OL,14,Fafter a man reported she had tried to
OL,15,Fget into his garden.
OL,17,FThe court heard the officers inquired
OL,18,Fabout her welfare and offered her a
OL,19,Flift home.
OL,26,@qD@NOUrD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,399,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786465167
OL,3,CWoman given hospital order for killing
OL,4,Cdisabled woman in sheltered
OL,5,Caccommodation
OL,7,FShe left the area at around 6.30pm
OL,8,Fafter a Morrisons worker came out of
OL,9,Fthe shop and told her to stop stealing
OL,10,Fwine from them.
OL,12,FMr Perks said minutes later, and 100
OL,13,Fmetres away, Ms Lloyd made the first
OL,14,Fof three calls to a Care Connect alarm
OL,15,Fservice.
OL,17,FThe court heard she suffered from a
OL,18,Fmuscle wasting condition and needed a
OL,19,Fwheelchair.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
