PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786465167
OL,3,CWoman given hospital order for killing
OL,4,Cdisabled woman in sheltered
OL,5,Caccommodation
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FMr Perks said the calls were unclear
OL,13,Fto the operator but on a later
OL,14,Ftranscription Ms Lloyd can be heard
OL,15,Fscreaming for help and saying she has
OL,16,Fan intruder in her house.
OL,18,FShe later said she was being stabbed
OL,19,Fto death and the defendant could be
OL,20,Fheard shouting "where's your money",
OL,21,Fthe court heard.
OL,26,@|D@POU|D@cO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G6/8
