OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,399,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786465167
OL,3,CWoman given hospital order for killing
OL,4,Cdisabled woman in sheltered
OL,5,Caccommodation
OL,7,FWhen Ms Lloyd's carer attended the
OL,8,Fproperty they found her lying
OL,9,Funresponsive on the kitchen floor,
OL,10,Fwith her Care Connect handset in one
OL,11,Fhand and prayer beads in the other.
OL,13,FThe court heard Hewitt went back to
OL,14,Fher sister, where she was described as
OL,15,F"increasingly agitated and incoherent".
OL,17,FStatements from Ms Lloyd's brothers
OL,18,Fread in court described her as a
OL,19,Fdevoted Catholic who lived a simple
OL,20,Flife and devoted her time to local
OL,21,Fcharities.
OL,26,@wD@AOUwD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G7/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,399,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786465167
OL,3,CWoman given hospital order for killing
OL,4,Cdisabled woman in sheltered
OL,5,Caccommodation
OL,7,FJoseph Lloyd said she was "taken away
OL,8,Ftoo soon by Patricia Hewitt for the
OL,9,Fsake of money".
OL,11,FHe added: "We are told she has mental
OL,12,Fhealth issues, however at some time
OL,13,Fshe will be free to carry on with her
OL,14,Flife."
OL,16,FThe court heard from a psychiatrist
OL,17,Fthat Hewitt had shown clear symptoms
OL,18,Fof schizophrenia which were "missed or
OL,19,Fvery much downplayed".
OL,26,@oD@[OUqD@NO]sD@KOUvD@FO]zD@]OU{D@UO]
